# SEO & Domain Standards

## Domain
Always use: `https://expertsecurityservices.online/`

```html
<!-- ❌ WRONG -->
https://expertsecurityservices.in/
https://expertsecurityservices.online  (no trailing slash for homepage)

<!-- ✅ CORRECT -->
https://expertsecurityservices.online/
https://expertsecurityservices.online/about.html
```

## URL Format
All pages use `.html` extension (except homepage):

```html
<!-- ❌ WRONG -->
/about
/services

<!-- ✅ CORRECT -->
/about.html
/services.html
```

## Canonical URLs
Every HTML page must have a canonical tag matching the sitemap URL:

```html
<link rel="canonical" href="https://expertsecurityservices.online/page-name.html">
```

## Sitemap Structure
- `sitemap.xml` - Index file referencing other sitemaps
- `sitemap-core.xml` - Homepage + main navigation + service pages
- `sitemap-locations.xml` - All location-specific pages

## Sitemap Entry Format

```xml
<!-- ✅ CORRECT - Simple and clean -->
<url>
  <loc>https://expertsecurityservices.online/page.html</loc>
  <lastmod>2026-01-24</lastmod>
  <priority>0.6</priority>
</url>

<!-- ❌ WRONG - Mixed formats, changefreq -->
<url>
  <loc>https://expertsecurityservices.online/page</loc>
  <lastmod>2026-01-24T08:36:15+00:00</lastmod>
  <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
</url>
```

## Priority Values
| Page Type | Priority |
|-----------|----------|
| Homepage | 1.0 |
| Main pages | 0.8 |
| Service pages | 0.7 |
| Location pages | 0.6 |
